=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/94ddd56a0f9032452883d54633a89188.webp?t=1762008990\" width=920 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against for the highest score<strong>\u00a0</strong>to assert your aerial supremacy. With every successful stage and high score, climb the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and prove that you are the ultimate feathered menace. Show humanity, and your fellow birds, who truly is the boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough with being called a \u201cflying rat\u201d and shooed away! It\u2019s payback time! Soar with grace, strike with fury, and show your enemies who the boss is.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a formidable <strong>feathered avenger</strong>, an unstoppable force of nature; your vengeance will be swift and absolute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/extras/a084723f746f5132f978b9ab04fca119.avif?t=1762008990\" width=920 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Runny Bird Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/6bd801a614e8b53b3dae91d08a2921fc9200c091/header.jpg?t=1762008990","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Birdoo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>M